  "display_title": "Can You Turn Down Freshly Baked Bread?",
  "description": "Oh Seong-Hwan, the owner of a bakery called 'Ppang Ppang Village' in a small provincial town. Since he was young, he has been linked up and down with all the gays in the neighborhood in search of true love, but has yet to meet someone he likes. Then one day, Seong-Hwan is insulted by his boyfriend and they break up. The scene is caught by Kim Ji-Woo, a part-time worker and disciple of the bakery. Ji-Woo immediately starts to confront Seong-Hwan, who is flustered, asking how he is?!\n\n *\"I can do better...! Please date me!\"*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
